    "status": "present",
    "value": "Generate expiring tokens, renew only unexpired tokens, and count tokens whose expiration is strictly after the current time. The approach is: absolute expiration map; expiration at current time precedes renewal/counting. Its target cost is generate/renew expected O(1), count O(tokens), O(tokens) space. Treat the invariant underlying that approach as the reason each local update preserves the required result. Check it against an independent bounded reference before relying on large-domain constructions."
  },
